MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR TUI_OS (VAULT WORLDWIDE):
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BLACK LANTERN canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.
Product truth: PRODUCT.md. Visual system after build: DESIGN.md.

This is one continuous personal OS field — not a dashboard, not stacked sections.
No cards, rounded corners, soft shadows, section billboards, DateBlocks, or teal watermarks.

PALETTE: Field #000000 · Paper #F4F4F0 · Power red #E10600.
Power red = underlines, selection invert, operator caret, live ticks, `[+]` / shovel, strike / URGENT.
One accent. Cobalt has left. Paper = type + month-free field ink.

TYPE: Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial. No JetBrains. No Space Grotesk. No globe seal.

COMPOSITION (desktop field, not a PWA, not mobile-first):
1. Composed SPECK canvas. Organs are placed ink (PLACE), not CSS regions. Window chrome: double hairline, plaque, `[x] ···`, tick ruler, circle counts.
2. One work graph. NEST is the tree. PIPE is the same nodes by status (FOCUS | GATEWAY). Empty ledger rows stay and create. HIT a task expands in place — rows below move down. No overlay CHIP covering neighbors.
3. Click-and-type on the cell. TAB cycles title → body → subtask → status. Dock is operator (commands + dump parser), not the title field.
4. SHOVEL / status puts a node on the binder. `[+]` adds a child. CLIP-copy is dead.
5. ONE one-line dock, locked to viewport bottom. Never three forms. Never header CTX tabs.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks, jagged day cards, SaaS kanban cards, amber theme, JSON-as-database, second prompt, cobalt lash.
Do not revive the globe seal, beige cassette chrome, month-as-OS, todo nest, scratch dump as home, or a Tailwind binder.
